From: ServerOmega <69215510+ServerOmega@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:31:13 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Rolling fill timer: FillAfter restarts on each new
 compatible joiner

FillTimerMode=Rolling (default) or FromFirst (pre-v8). MaxFillWaitSeconds
(default 90, 0 = no cap) is a hard cap from the first searcher. Four
compatible solos still shuffle into one 2v2 immediately; pre-formed pairs
stay together. 16 tests including the 2026-11-14 four-cab timeline
(joins at t=0, 24, 30.5, 42).

Co-authored-by: Grok Bot <grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
